---

<section class="section sync" id="sync">
	<div class="wrap">
		<p class="eyebrow reveal">Cloud sync</p>
		<h2 class="section-title reveal">Sync that cannot read your data.</h2>
		<p class="section-lead reveal">
			Your password is the encryption secret, not just a login. Everything is encrypted
			on your machine before it leaves, so the server only ever stores ciphertext. Not
			your clips, not your notes, not even your settings are readable to anyone but you.
		</p>

		<div class="flow reveal" aria-label="How encryption travels">
			<div class="node">
				<div class="node-title">Your device</div>
				<div class="node-body mono">Meet at the station, platform 4</div>
				<div class="node-note">Plaintext stays here</div>
			</div>
			<div class="arrow">
				<span class="lock">AES-256-GCM</span>
			</div>
			<div class="node">
				<div class="node-title">The server</div>
				<div class="node-body mono cipher">q9J2xK41Vd8mThPZC7oW3nRl...</div>
				<div class="node-note">Ciphertext only. No key, ever.</div>
			</div>
			<div class="arrow">
				<span class="lock">wrapped key</span>
			</div>
			<div class="node">
				<div class="node-title">Your other devices</div>
				<div class="node-body mono">Meet at the station, platform 4</div>
				<div class="node-note">Decrypted on arrival</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="modes reveal">
			<div class="mode">
				<h3>Realtime</h3>
				<p>
					Items from your other devices arrive the moment they are copied, and what you
					copy here uploads right away.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="mode">
				<h3>Passive</h3>
				<p>
					Items from your other devices arrive every 5 minutes, or when you press
					Refresh. What you copy here still uploads right away.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="mode">
				<h3>Manual</h3>
				<p>
					Nothing new uploads on its own. Pick what to send with Upload to cloud, on an
					item or on a selection.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="mode-note reveal">
			The mode is per device. Deletes travel too, offline work queues up, and conflicts
			resolve to the latest edit.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.sync {
	}

	.flow {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr) auto minmax(0,1fr) auto minmax(0,1fr);
		gap: 0.9rem;
		align-items: stretch;
		margin-bottom: 3rem;
	}

	.node {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 1.1rem;
	}

	.node-title {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.55rem;
	}

	.node-body {
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		background: var(--bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
		padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
		overflow: hidden;
		text-overflow: ellipsis;
	}

	.mono {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
	}

	.cipher {
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.node-note {
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.arrow {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		position: relative;
		min-width: 90px;
	}

	.arrow::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		right: 0;
		top: 50%;
		border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
	}

	.lock {
		position: relative;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.62rem;
		color: var(--accent);
		background: var(--bg);
		border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim-strong);
		border-radius: 9px;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.modes {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0.9rem;
	}

	.mode {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
	}

	.mode h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.mode p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.87rem;
		color: var(--text-secondary);
	}

	.mode-note {
		margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.flow {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
		.arrow {
			min-height: 44px;
		}
		.arrow::before {
			left: 50%;
			right: auto;
			top: 0;
			bottom: 0;
			border-top: none;
			border-left: 1px dashed var(--border-light);
		}
		.modes {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
	}
</style>
